[[Sundown Marsh]] is the deepest part of the [[Wetlands]], where an odd couple make their home. [[Fradd Swiftgear]] and [[Wenna Silkbeard]] live here in a small stone dwelling with a windmill. They sell peculiar items they come across in the marsh, and also some uncommon recipes. The swampland on all sides are full of aggressive [[crocolisks]], [[gnolls]], [[raptors]], [[bog beasts]] and [[oozes]], which discourage inexperienced adventurers from approaching.

